    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.009",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 9,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 159,
      "width": 342,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 44,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 49,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "A few things",
        "worth knowing."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-5d10a8202ac7",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.010",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 10,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 287,
      "width": 335,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 16,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 23.2,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "What PAIA keeps, what you control, and",
        "what the beta does not promise."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-626aaaf8531f",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.011",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 11,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 403.4,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 403.4,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.012",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 12,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 430.4,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "What does PAIA keep?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-b489db01f851",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.013",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 13,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 490.4,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 21.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA focuses on your own submitted inputs",
        "and the provenance needed to revisit them. It",
        "is not a promise to copy every assistant reply",
        "or every file."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-68e054397389",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.014",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 14,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 624.4,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 624.4,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.015",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 15,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 651.4,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Do I need to organize everything?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-fbbc548f84cc",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.016",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 16,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 711.4,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 21.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "No. Reading, finding, editing and copying",
        "useful words should already be valuable.",
        "Topics and optional AI organization are ways",
        "to go further, not admission requirements."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-5738350082c0",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.017",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 17,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 845.4,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 845.4,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.018",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 18,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 872.4,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Does everything get sent to AI?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-959dc5038307",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.019",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 19,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 932.4,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 21.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "No. Ordinary archive use is local-first.",
        "Optional external AI processing and context",
        "reuse are separate, explicit actions with their",
        "own boundaries."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-dbd48596dae5",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.020",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 20,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 1066.4,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 1066.4,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.021",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 21,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1093.4,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Which platforms can I use today?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-0bbf52a58ad5",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.022",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 22,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1153.4,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 21.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "The current invitation-only beta is a Chrome",
        "extension with consented ChatGPT input",
        "capture. Other providers, mobile apps and an",
        "external AI-reader connector are not",
        "promised as available installations."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-5d457501a24e",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.023",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 23,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 1309.15,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 1309.15,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.024",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 24,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1336.15,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Why use this alongside chat",
        "history?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-4a3a52baf411",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.025",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 25,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1429.15,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 21.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "PAIA is a separate working layer for your own",
        "words: revisit, edit, trace the original and",
        "select what to reuse. It can help even when",
        "you use only one AI product."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-43a12da5dd60",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.026",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 26,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 1563.15,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 1563.15,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.027",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 27,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1590.15,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Can I change the wording?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-1270025d85bf",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.028",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 28,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1650.15,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 21.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "You can work with an editable version without",
        "making today’s changes look like yesterday’s",
        "original expression. The original and the",
        "working version have different roles."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-10933f7cd5b7",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.029",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 29,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 1784.15,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 1784.15,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.030",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 30,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1811.15,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Is this a backup of my entire AI",
        "account?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-2570e65d91e1",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.031",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 31,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 1904.15,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 21.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "No. Capture, supported history import and",
        "PAIA backup have different scopes. The beta",
        "does not promise complete recovery of an",
        "external AI account."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-fe483e1c2850",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.032",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 32,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 2038.15,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 2038.15,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.033",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 33,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2065.15,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Does local-first mean no network",
        "traffic?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-4770789b9c2d",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.034",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 34,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2158.15,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 21.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "No. The website is hosted online, the beta",
        "application uses a disclosed forwarding",
        "service, and optional external AI has a",
        "separate network boundary. Local-first is not",
        "an encryption certification."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-9d11af7f9458",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.035",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 35,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 2313.9,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 2313.9,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.036",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 36,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2340.9,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Is a copied passage one of my",
        "beliefs?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-92ae6b6a4b7e",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.037",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 37,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2433.9,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 21.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "Not necessarily. It might be a quotation, a job",
        "description, a draft, a question or a role-play.",
        "PAIA should preserve that distinction instead",
        "of inventing a personal profile."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-c97f7ef31fd4",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.038",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 38,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 2567.9,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 2567.9,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.039",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 39,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2594.9,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Can PAIA recall something I sent",
        "elsewhere?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-d0eb0ef60b44",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.040",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 40,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2687.9,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 21.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "No. PAIA can stop future access that it",
        "controls, but cannot recall a copy you have",
        "already sent to another system or exported."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-aaf9ac84cd92",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.041",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 41,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 2800.15,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 2800.15,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.042",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 42,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2827.15,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "Is the website example my actual",
        "archive?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-ebd37bc6c22b",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.043",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 43,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 2920.15,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 21.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "No. It uses fictional material. It does not",
        "connect to your archive or run a live AI model.",
        "Refreshing clears temporary example",
        "changes."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-e44b2b70eaf6",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.044",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 44,
      "x1": 24,
      "y1": 3054.15,
      "x2": 366,
      "y2": 3054.15,
      "stroke": "#dfe2dc",
      "stroke_width": 1
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.045",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 45,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 3081.15,
      "width": 336,
      "font_family": "EB Garamond 12",
      "font_size": 25,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 33,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#171c19",
      "lines": [
        "How do I get access?"
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-780bd2633c7d",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.046",
      "kind": "text",
      "paint_order": 46,
      "x": 24,
      "y": 3141.15,
      "width": 328,
      "font_family": "Inter",
      "font_size": 15,
      "font_style": "normal",
      "line_height": 21.75,
      "letter_spacing": 0,
      "color": "#616969",
      "lines": [
        "Apply for the invitation-only private beta.",
        "Submitting a form is not an installation,",
        "admission decision or verified email-delivery",
        "receipt."
      ],
      "copy_id": "copy-a0adc260f5c4",
      "role": "text",
      "anchor": "start"
    },
    {
      "id": "faq-en-390.047",
      "kind": "line",
      "paint_order": 47,
      "x1": 24,
